  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-agy-cli",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-agy-cli)\n[](LICENSE)\n\n把本机已登录的 **Google Antigravity CLI（`agy`）** 接入 [DeepSeek Harness (DSH)](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) 作为一级模型提供方。\n\n**这个插件的三件事：**\n\n1. **生成流量由官方二进制自己签名** —— 每一轮模型请求都通过官方 `agy.exe` 发出，插件不代它签名、不接管它的生成链路，模型侧的风控面与官方客户端一致。\n2. **吃到 Antigravity 账号的官方额度** —— 消耗打在你自己的套餐上，与官方客户端同池同规则，不需要 API Key。\n3. **AGY 只当模型，DSH 接管 harness** —— 工具执行、审批、沙箱、上下文预算 100% 在 DSH；AGY 自带的 agent 循环被剥离。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-agy-cli",
      "text": "> **平台限制**：**仅 Windows**。配额面板与凭据保活依赖 Windows Credential Manager；其余功能无跨平台实现，未在 macOS/Linux 验证。\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "凭据与网络行为（如实写清）",
      "text": "- **读取**：Windows Credential Manager 里 AGY 写入的 Google OAuth blob（target `gemini:antigravity`），由 `src/agy/keepalive.ts` 的 `CredRead` 完成。用途有两个：判断令牌是否临近过期并触发一次官方 CLI 续期；读取 `access_token` 用于下面的配额查询。读到的令牌只在进程内使用，不落日志、不进错误消息。\n- **配额查询（唯一的插件自带出站请求）**：把上面读到的 `access_token` 作为 `Authorization: Bearer` 发往 `https://daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com` 与 `https://cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com` 的只读配额 RPC（`retrieveUserQuotaSummary` / `fetchAvailableModels`），并附带 AGY 客户端的身份头（`User-Agent` / `X-Goog-Api-Client`）——服务端对不同客户端返回的配额分组不同，不带身份头会漏掉 Gemini 组。**请求只发往 Google 这两个端点，不外传第三方。**\n- **不做的**：不拦截、不重放、不伪造生成请求；不把令牌交给任何第三方；不读取除上述 target 以外的凭据。\n- **续期**：令牌轮换完全由官方 `agy.exe` 自己完成，插件只负责在到期前拉起它一次。"
    },
    {
      "section": "凭据与网络行为（如实写清）",
      "text": "实测依据见 `docs/prod-generation-feasibility-20261020.md`（两个端点的配额语义、身份头对返回值的影响）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **双工具路线**：MCP 桥把 DSH 工具交给 AGY（真工具事件、过程流可视化，推荐），失败自动降级为 prompt 契约\n- **DSH 主导 harness**：工作区、审批、沙箱、上下文预算全在 DSH；AGY 只出模型\n- **流式 + 状态机**：`stdinMode: hold` 防回滚、工具步骤折叠显示（只列执行了哪些工具，不显示模型的内部思考内容）、尾流交付、断连保文本\n- **会话管理 + 历史指纹链**：resume / full 双模式，每轮成功后记录 DSH 历史指纹；resume 前本地比对前缀，检出历史被编辑/压缩/截断即废弃旧会话并从完整历史重建，delta prompt 不会落在过期上下文上；死亡会话自动重放，会话映射落盘可迁移\n- **图片输入**（experimental）：附件经图片桥落盘，由最小权限的 view_file Agent 查看\n- **配额面板与凭据保活**：loopback-only；面板显示真实双窗口配额，令牌临近过期时自动拉起官方 CLI 续期\n- **安全加固**：原型污染防线、MCP 桥面闸门、面板 loopback 门与原子写、凭据脱敏——全部有测试背书"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```console\ndsh plugin --profile <你的 profile> add dsh-agy-cli\n```\n\n前置要求：Windows；本机已安装并登录官方 Antigravity CLI（`agy`）；Node ≥ 22。\n\n**装完必须再跑一步**（否则 AGY 会报 unknown agent——插件自带的 Agent 预设没有装进 AGY 的 agent 目录）：\n\n```console\nnpx dsh-agy-cli agents install read-only --apply\nnpx dsh-agy-cli agents install workspace-write --apply\n```\n\n`--apply` 会写入 `~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/gemini-root-config/agents`；`--backup` 可先备份，`agents list` 可查看当前状态。宿主重启后，设置页「模型」里会出现本插件的配置卡（模型可见性、推理强度、配额面板）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "**诊断**：`npx dsh-agy-cli doctor --profile <profile>` —— 覆盖安装、bundle 声明、Agent 预设、配置解析、凭据状态，全程不消耗额度。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发与门禁",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm ci --ignore-scripts\nnpm run typecheck\nnpm test    # tsc 全量 → 320 例 node --test\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "MIT。源码衍生自 Darkings 的 `dsh-agy-provider`（MIT）；原作者版权与完整提交历史保留于 `LICENSE` 与本仓 git 历史。"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-agy-cli",
      "text": "[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-agy-cli)\n[](LICENSE)\n\nRuns the locally authenticated **Google Antigravity CLI (`agy`)** as a first-class model provider for [DeepSeek Harness (DSH)](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness).\n\n**What this plugin does, in three points:**"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-agy-cli",
      "text": "1. **Generation is signed by the official binary.** Every model request goes out through the official `agy.exe`; the plugin does not sign it, proxy it, or replace its generation path, so the model-side risk surface matches the official client.\n2. **Spends your Antigravity quota.** Requests draw on your own subscription under the same pool and rules as the official client. No API key.\n3. **AGY is only the model; DSH owns the harness.** Tool execution, approvals, sandbox and context budgeting stay 100% inside DSH; AGY's own agent loop is stripped."
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-agy-cli",
      "text": "> **Platform: Windows only.** The quota panel and credential keep-alive depend on Windows Credential Manager. The other features have no cross-platform implementation and are untested on macOS/Linux.\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Credentials and network behaviour (stated plainly)",
      "text": "- **Reads**: the Google OAuth blob that AGY stores in Windows Credential Manager (target `gemini:antigravity`), via `CredRead` in `src/agy/keepalive.ts`. Used for two things: deciding whether the token is close to expiry and should trigger one official-CLI renewal, and reading `access_token` for the quota queries below. The token stays in process memory; it is never logged or placed in an error message.\n- **Quota queries — the only outbound request the plugin makes itself**: the token above is sent as `Authorization: Bearer` to the read-only quota RPCs of `https://daily-cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com` and `https://cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com`, together with AGY client identity headers (`User-Agent` / `X-Goog-Api-Client`) — the server returns different quota groups per client, and omitting them drops the Gemini group. **Those requests go to those two Google endpoints only; nothing is sent to third parties.**\n- **Not done**: no interception, replay or forgery of generation requests; no token handed to third parties; no credentials read beyond the target above.\n- **Renewal**: token rotation is performed entirely by the official `agy.exe`; the plugin only launches it once before expiry."
    },
    {
      "section": "Credentials and network behaviour (stated plainly)",
      "text": "Evidence for the endpoint semantics and identity-header behaviour: `docs/prod-generation-feasibility-20261020.md`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```console\ndsh plugin --profile <your profile> add dsh-agy-cli\n```\n\nRequires Windows, the official Antigravity CLI installed and signed in locally, and Node ≥ 22.\n\n**One more step, or AGY will report an unknown agent** (the bundled agent presets are not copied into AGY's agent directory by the install alone):\n\n```console\nnpx dsh-agy-cli agents install read-only --apply\nnpx dsh-agy-cli agents install workspace-write --apply\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "`--apply` writes into `~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/gemini-root-config/agents`; add `--backup` first if you want a copy, and `agents list` shows the current state. After a host restart the plugin's card appears under Settings → Models (model visibility, reasoning effort, quota panel).\n\n**Diagnostics**: `npx dsh-agy-cli doctor --profile <profile>` — install, bundle declaration, agent presets, config parsing and credential state, without spending quota."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT. Source derived from Darkings' `dsh-agy-provider` (MIT); the original copyright and full commit history are preserved in `LICENSE` and in this repository's git history."
    }
